---
/** Homepage diagram: a typical production setup we look after. Wide version for desktop, tall for phones. */
---
<figure class="frame rise rise-3" style="margin:0">
  <div class="frame-cap"><span>Fig. 01 · A typical cloud-hosted application</span><span>What we look after</span></div>

  <svg class="diag diag-wide" viewBox="0 0 560 330" role="img" aria-label="Diagram of a typical cloud-hosted application: users reach the app through a firewall, the app runs in two zones with failover, and data is encrypted and backed up. Setup, security, reliability and cost are what we look after across all of it.">
    <path class="dash" d="M8 24H552"/><path class="ln" d="M8 18V30M552 18V30"/>
    <rect class="mask" x="200" y="14" width="160" height="22"/>
    <text class="t-mono" x="280" y="29" text-anchor="middle">CLOUD ENVIRONMENT</text>

    <rect class="box" x="8" y="138" width="96" height="60"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="20" y="160">USERS</text><text class="t-sub" x="20" y="182">web · mobile</text>

    <rect class="box" x="132" y="138" width="112" height="60"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="144" y="160">EDGE</text><text class="t-sub" x="144" y="182">HTTPS · FILTERING</text>

    <rect class="box" x="280" y="66" width="150" height="56"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="292" y="87">APP · ZONE A</text><text class="t-sub" x="292" y="108">containers</text>

    <rect class="box" x="280" y="214" width="150" height="56"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="292" y="235">APP · ZONE B</text><text class="t-sub" x="292" y="256">second zone</text>

    <rect class="box-hl" x="466" y="138" width="86" height="60"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="478" y="160">DATA</text><text class="t-sub" x="478" y="182">encrypted</text>

    <path class="ln" d="M104 168H132M244 168H262V94H280M262 168V242H280M430 94H448V168H466M430 242H448V168"/>
    <circle class="dot" cx="132" cy="168" r="3.5"/><circle class="dot" cx="280" cy="94" r="3.5"/><circle class="dot" cx="280" cy="242" r="3.5"/><circle class="dot" cx="466" cy="168" r="3.5"/>
    <path class="acc-dash" d="M355 122V214"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="364" y="172">failover</text>

    <path class="dash" d="M8 306H552"/><path class="ln" d="M8 300V312M552 300V312"/>
    <rect class="mask" x="128" y="296" width="304" height="22"/>
    <text class="t-mono" x="280" y="311" text-anchor="middle">SETUP · SECURITY · RELIABILITY · COST</text>
  </svg>

  <svg class="diag diag-tall" viewBox="0 0 320 420" role="img" aria-label="Diagram: users reach your app through an edge layer, the app runs in two zones with failover, and both use a backed-up data store.">
    <path class="dash" d="M8 20H312"/><path class="ln" d="M8 14V26M312 14V26"/>
    <rect class="mask" x="88" y="10" width="144" height="22"/>
    <text class="t-mono" x="160" y="25" text-anchor="middle">CLOUD ENVIRONMENT</text>

    <rect class="box" x="100" y="44" width="120" height="52"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="112" y="64">USERS</text><text class="t-sub" x="112" y="84">web · mobile</text>
    <path class="ln" d="M160 96V120"/><circle class="dot" cx="160" cy="120" r="3.5"/>
    <rect class="box" x="100" y="120" width="120" height="52"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="112" y="140">EDGE</text><text class="t-sub" x="112" y="160">HTTPS · FILTERING</text>
    <path class="ln" d="M160 172V192M76 192H244M76 192V212M244 192V212"/>
    <rect class="box" x="8" y="212" width="136" height="52"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="20" y="232">APP · ZONE A</text><text class="t-sub" x="20" y="252">containers</text>
    <rect class="box" x="176" y="212" width="136" height="52"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="188" y="232">APP · ZONE B</text><text class="t-sub" x="188" y="252">second zone</text>
    <path class="acc-dash" d="M144 238H176"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="160" y="284" text-anchor="middle">failover</text>
    <path class="ln" d="M76 264V300H244V264M160 300V316"/><circle class="dot" cx="160" cy="316" r="3.5"/>
    <rect class="box-hl" x="100" y="316" width="120" height="52"/>
    <text class="t-label" x="112" y="336">DATA</text><text class="t-sub" x="112" y="356">encrypted · backed up</text>
    <path class="dash" d="M8 398H312"/><path class="ln" d="M8 392V404M312 392V404"/>
    <rect class="mask" x="22" y="388" width="276" height="22"/>
    <text class="t-mono" x="160" y="403" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:11px">SETUP · SECURITY · RELIABILITY · COST</text>
  </svg>
</figure>
